 8. ☕ 1 fun thing: Coffee competition 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Illustration: Maura Losch/Axios

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The long-reigning pumpkin spice latte has new rivals, Axios' Carly Mallenbaum writes. 

 Caramel, apple and cinnamon are the three most-ordered fall flavors on DoorDash, ahead of pumpkin, per data shared with Axios. Searches for "caramel apple iced coffee" are at an all-time high, according to Google Trends. Case in point: McDonald's dropped its longtime PSL and instead rolled out caramel apple pie coffee drinks this season, saying : "Step aside pumpkin spice, there's a new flavor in town!"

